        }
      }
    }
  },
  "body": {
    "comment": "I do not disagree with much of the proposed roadmap items, however, I need there to be a little more detail even for an info action. \n\nI would also like to see timelines and priorities. Maybe we have a 1 year road map, a 4 year road map, and an 8 year road map? I think these types of questions need to be asl first, urgently, so that we may progress, as a whole, to a more effective and standard road map idea."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
}